flowchart TD
    A[Customer question + chat history] --> B[Query condensation]
    B --> C[Embedding model]
    D[Knowledge base: MD / CSV / PDF / DOCX] --> E[Loader + metadata]
    E --> F[Recursive text splitter]
    F --> G[Embedding model]
    G --> H[(Persistent Chroma vector store)]
    C --> I[Retriever: similarity / MMR]
    H --> I
    I --> J{Relevance gate}
    J -- no supporting chunks --> K[Grounded refusal]
    J -- relevant chunks --> L[Context formatting + source labels]
    L --> M[Grounded system prompt + LLM]
    M --> N[Pydantic response validation]
    N --> O[Answer + validated citations + logs]
    K --> O
